Package: openmediavault-immich
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.0)
Priority: optional
Description: openmediavault Immich plugin
 Manage the Immich photo library (self-hosted Google Photos alternative)
 from the OpenMediaVault web interface: the plugin renders the Docker
 Compose stack (immich-server, redis, database and the optional
 machine-learning service) into a configurable directory, starts/stops/
 restarts/updates it via 'docker compose' background tasks and reports
 the live container status, the running Immich version and available
 upstream updates. Includes Chinese translations.
